description: Art import from the external iDL Art Studio (D-51, D-52)
globs: tools/import_art.py,tools/tests/test_import_art.py,tools/testdata/art_incoming/**,art/incoming/**,docs/avatar/ART_INTERCHANGE.md
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `COORDINATION.md` first. The contract is `docs/avatar/ART_INTERCHANGE.md`; the task is
  `docs/handoff/ART_IMPORT_TASK.md`.
- `tools/import_art.py` is standard-library only, like `tools/asset_pipeline.py`. Its tests are
  `unittest` in `tools/tests/` and run in `scripts/check.sh` and CI.
- `tools/testdata/art_incoming/` are the studio exporter's synthetic fixtures: never import them into a
  real pack, never edit them by hand (the studio regenerates them).
- Never commit `art/incoming/`; never edit the studio repo (`Z:\ai-tools\idl-art-studio`). Contract
  changes start as a spec PR here, then a studio task.
